@startuml
' Strategy Pattern template diagram.
' Suggested LaTeX placement: normal page.

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false

class Client

class Context {
  -strategy : Strategy
  +setStrategy(strategy)
  +execute()
}

interface Strategy {
  +algorithm()
}

class ConcreteStrategy {
  +algorithm()
}

Client --> Context
Context o--> Strategy
ConcreteStrategy ..|> Strategy

note right of Strategy
  Concrete strategies implement the same interface
  so the context can use an algorithm through abstraction.
end note

@enduml
